21","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":" (तलबद्ध = बद्धतल, Having put on a leathern fence, etc., cf. तलत्र), "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 2, 87, 23","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Comp."}]}]},{"id":"tAla","headword":"ताल","headword_slp1":"tAla","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"ताल,\n I. m.\n 1. The palmyra tree, or fan palm, Borassus flabelliformis, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 1, 1, 64","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":"; used as banner, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 6, 1811.\n 2","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":". Slapping or clapping the hands together, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Megh. 77","q":"Megh"},{"t":"txt","s":"; often compounded with a word denoting hand, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 13, 1397.\n 3","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":". Slapping together in general, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Ragh. 9, 71.\n 4","q":"Ragh"},{"t":"txt","s":". Musical measure, Pañc. v. d. 43; "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 13, 995.\n 5","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":". A sort of cymbal, Pañc. 20, 8.\n II. n. The fruit of the palmyra tree, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Hariv. 3711","q":"Hariv"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n III. f. लि, The name of a tree. Corypha taliera Roxb., "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 4, 43, 6","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Comp."}]}]}],"talatala":[{"id":"talAtala","headword":"तलातल","headword_slp1":"talAtala","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"तलातल, i. e. तल-अ-तल, n. the name of a hell, Vedāntas. in "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 209, 2","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]},{"id":"talatAla","headword":"तलताल","headword_slp1":"talatAla","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"+ ताल तल- + ताल, m. slapping the hands together, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 3, 12379","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":"."}]}]}],"talatas":[{"id":"talatas","headword":"तलतस्","headword_slp1":"talatas","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"तल + तस्, adv. From the bottom, Śiś. 9, 20."}]}]}],"talatra":[{"id":"talatra","headword":"तलत्र","headword_slp1":"talatra","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"तल + त्र (vb. त्रा), n. A leathern fence worn by archers on